      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "Vyacheslav Argenberg from Seattle, WA, USA",
      "credit": "This is my church (2006-08-108)",
      "source": "This is my church (2006-08-108) (327847300)",
      "description": "This is my church. This is where I heal my hurts. It's a natural grace of watching young life shape. It's in minor keys solutions and remedies. Enemies becoming friends when bitterness ends. This is my church.\n\nThis is my church. This is where I heal my hurts. It's in the world I become contained in the hum between voice and drum. It's in the change the poetic justice of cause and effect. Respect, love, compassion. This is my church. This is where I heal my hurts. For tonight God is a DJ.",
